# Oaks [KoU] Container Opener Script
# Will open all backpacks, non-trapped pouches, bags, potion satchels, wizard satchels, quivers, adventurers satchels.
# Never miss out on taking potions again because the bag is open!
# You can place this at the beginning of your background looping script, before it goes into the loop.


@setvar! minWait 350
clearignore

dclick backpack
wait minWait
while findtype 3701|3702|3705|31262|30765|12215|24246 self
    if findtype 3705 self 38 as trappedPouch
        @ignore! trappedPouch
    elseif findtype 3701|3702|3705|31262|30765|12215|24246 self as found
        dclick found
        wait minWait
        @ignore! found
    endif
endwhile

clearignore 